<title>USA: Western Resources cleared to complete offer.</title>
<headline>Western Resources cleared to complete offer.</headline>
<dateline>TOPEKA, Kan. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Resources said on Tuesday it received the Kansas Corporation Commission's approval to issue more stock to raise the funds needed to complete its acquisition offer for ADT Ltd.</p>
<p>Western Resources announced its bid for ADT in December.</p>
</text>
